ut was captured by Liu Bei and surrendered. During the Hanzhong campaign, he served under Ma Chao. He was killed in battle against Cao Zhang, who had come to reinforce Cao Cao at the Han River.","jp":"元は劉璋の部将。劉備が蜀を攻めた際、呉懿らと共に張任の救援に赴くも、逆に劉備に捕らえられて降伏した。漢中攻防戦の折には馬超の配下を務めた。漢水にて曹操の救援に駆けつけた曹彰に敗れ、討ち取られた。","kr":"본래 유장의 부장이었습니다. 유비가 촉을 공략할 때 오의 등과 함께 장임을 구원하러 출진했으나, 도리어 유비에게 사로잡혀 항복했습니다. 한중 공방전 당시에는 마초의 부하로 참전했습니다. 이후 한수에서 조조를 구원하러 온 조창에게 맞섰으나 패하여 전사했습니다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10367","remark":"","surname":"吴","surnameTc":"吳","surnameEn":"Wu","surnameJp":"呉","surnameKr":"오","surnameOther":"","name":"兰","nameTc":"蘭","nameEn":"Lan","nameJp":"蘭","nameKr":"란","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"吴兰","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"189","city":"CS1038","gender":"0","rule":"68","force":"80","wise":"35","politics":"36","charm":"42","will":"50","ruleTalent":"7","forceTalent":"10","wiseTalent":"2","politicsTalent":"2","charmTalent":"3","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"32/83/32/32/32/11/50/32","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1004202;1002200","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1012305","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"4600","battleSoulPoint":"6400","debateSoulPoint":"1200","strategy":"","strategy2":"1005401","professions":"1/1/1/0/0/0/2/0/0/0/0/1/4/0/2/0/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/0","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"5","compatible":"39","loyalty":"0","reputation":"2100","evaluate":"2000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"170","show":"189","death":"218","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1008705","helmet":"WP10206